<title>INDIA: SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Mahindra</p>
<p>international squash tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Stefan Casteleyn (Belgium) 17-15</p>
<p>14-15 15-11 9-15 15-10</p>
<p>Jonathan Power (Canada) beat Ahmed Faizy (Egypt) 15-9 15-7 15-1</p>
<p>Danny Harris (England) beat Graham Ryding (Canada) 12-15 15-5</p>
<p>15-13 15-3</p>
<p>Paul Gregory (Greece) beat Amir Singh (India) 15-13 15-12 15-12</p>
<p>Omar El Borolossey (Egypt) beat Brett Martin (Australia) 15-5</p>
<p>15-2 15-3</p>
<p>Mark Cairns (England) beat Paul Johnson (England) 15-13 15-6</p>
<p>15-12</p>
<p>Craig Wapnick (South Africa) beat Craig Rowland (Australia)</p>
<p>15-8</p>
<p>15-12 17-15</p>
<p>Derek Ryan (Ireland) beat Dan Jenson (Australia) 15-10 15-6</p>
<p>15-11</p>
<p>Simon Parke (England) beat Akhil Behl (India) 15-6 15-4 15-9</p>
<p>Amir Wagih (Egypt) beat Anthony Hill (Australia) 15-13 17-14</p>
<p>1-0 (Hill withdrew)</p>
<p>Zubair Jahan (Pakistan) beat Juha Raumolin (Finland) 15-7 9-15</p>
<p>15-11</p>
<p>15-13</p>
<p>Zarak Jahan (Pakistan) beat Chris Walker (England)  Walker</p>
<p>disqualified for late arrival</p>
<p>Mark Chaloner (England) beat Tony Hands (England) 15-14 9-15</p>
<p>15-8</p>
<p>12-15 15-11</p>
<p>Stephen Meads (England) beat Julien Bonetat (France) 15-11 15-2</p>
<p>15-2</p>
<p>Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Martin Heath (Scotland) 15-9 15-9</p>
<p>15-10</p>
<p>Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Abdul Faheem Khan (Hong Kong) 15-14</p>
<p>15-10 15-11</p>
</text>
